# Email templates

Keep invoice and payment emails as TypeScript HTML in `src/emails/`, including `shared.ts` brand colours and `emailShell`.

- Do not add a parallel `.mjml` / compiled `.html` tree.
- Do not `npm install mjml` unless the user explicitly asks for an MJML redesign.
- Preserve `{{placeholder}}` interpolation and HTML escaping from `shared.ts`.
